{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50741","headline":"早秋贵溪南亭晚眺 · 张祜","name":"早秋贵溪南亭晚眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪流照槛肃埃氛，百里秋光草树分。\n青壁峻时山背日，碧潭空处水销云。\n千寻下彻鱼无隐，一点高飞鹭出羣。\n回首故乡人未去，乱蝉声噪不堪闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}